<title>UK: Wuestenrot Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Wuestenrot Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUESTENROT HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.25     MATURITY    25.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.10    PAY DATE    25.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	LISTING    STUTTGART DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 25.FEB.98 THEN STEPS-UP TO 5.0 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 111</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
